TI  - SceneDiffuser++: City-Scale Traffic Simulation via a Generative World Model
PY  - 2025
T2  - 2025 IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)
SP  - 1570
EP  - 1580
DO  - 10.1109/CVPR52734.2025.00154
